  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Discussion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "To provide a promotional-offer retention message, you need to cryptographically sign the offer and include it in the `promotionalOffer` parameter of your `RealtimeResponseBody` response.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/promotionalOffer",
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/RealtimeResponseBody"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "> **Tip**\n>\n> For a simpler implementation, use `promotionalOfferSignatureV2` instead.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/promotionalOfferSignatureV2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For instructions on generating the `encodedSignature` for the `promotionalOfferSignatureV1`, see `generating-a-signature-for-promotional-offers`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/StoreKit/generating-a-signature-for-promotional-offers"
          ]
        }
      ],
